title: Counting
---
Lona: On the count of 3, Im gonna find you
Lona: 1
Lona: 2
Lona: 3
Lona: Ready or not, here I come!
===

title: Found_Jason
---
Lona: Found You!
Jason: AHH—!
Jason: Ow…
Jason: Man. I really thought that was a good spot.
Lona: I guess I’m just better than you.
Jason: You asked me what color an orange was yesterday.
Lona: And you still haven’t answered me.
Jason: …It’s orange.
Lona: Oh.
Lona: Okay, then
Lona: My Turn!
Lona: I'm gonna find the best hiding spot ever.
Jason: Don’t bury yourself again.
Lona: That was ONE time!
Jason: Yeah, and I had to dig you out.
Lona: You didn't have to.
Jason: You were literally yelling for help.
Lona: Okay, whatever!
Lona: Just count!
Jason: Fine, fine.
Jason: One…
===

title: Forest_Later
---
Lona: Whoa...
Jason2: There you are
Jason2: You know you’re really bad at hide-and-seek, right?
Lona: Look
Jason2: ...What?
Lona: That.
Jason2: The creepy building?
Lona: I think it’s a hospital.
Jason2: Okay
Lona: Okay?
Jason2: Yeah. Cool. Let’s go home.
Lona: Wait, what?
Jason2: We're not going in there.
Lona: Why not?
Jason2: Because it's abandoned.
Lona: So?
Jason2: So… people don’t just leave hospitals for no reason.
Lona: Maybe there's something inside.
Jason2: Yeah. Probably roaches
Lona: Big Roaches?
Jason2: Huge.
Lona: Even better.
Jason2: Wait. No, that’s not what I—
Jason2: Lona
Jason2: Lona, seriously
Lona: What?
Jason2: We’re not going in.
Lona: I’m going in.
Jason2: Why?!
Lona: ‘Cause I wanna see what’s inside.
Jason2: That’s how people die in movies.
Lona: This isn’t a movie.
Jason2: That’s what people in movies say.
Lona: Are you coming or not?
Jason2: …Fine.
Lona: Knew you’d come.
Lona: You’re scared.
Jason2: I’m not scared.
Lona: You’re holding my shirt.
Jason2: I wasn’t.
Lona: You literally were.
Jason2: ...Whatever.
===